{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Horde is Coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will arrive by nightfall, and you are woefully unprepared. With any luck, you'll make it out of this alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore your Surroundings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/Map.png?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 6 unique locations, you must scour all of them to prepare for the oncoming horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find and Craft Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the items you find and combine them together to create useful tools and traps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch the Clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/TimeDisplay.png?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every action costs valuable time. With only one day, you must use it wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/Hideout.png?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hideout could use a few touch-ups, along with some elaborate traps. However, you'll need to find the right equipment for the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the Dawn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the right preparations, you may be able to fend off the horde and survive another day.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unscathed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1760710/a7347531af78b3c38744465d6249c46944832cab.jpg"},{"name":"Uncertain future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1760710/a7347531af78b3c38744465d6249c46944832cab.jpg"},